#: scenario7:scenario7_9ED0C5D0_A167_4441_98DD_EA5BCB38F709
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b10168620112a4220c66644d3fa7993f2f675a1415f54fd4b5fce46e1b87bf8e
#. default-sha256: 87d7ac3bc93e0b28e41bca478f41e3b67507bcc3456dd3652583eb9f82d2af86
