msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I received no visitors except the servants—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫and "
"again, none of them would look me in the eye."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Não recebi nenhuma visita, exceto os criados —⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫ e "
"novamente, nenhum deles me olhava nos olhos."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E4DB4FB6_DCE0_4EA0_B57D_1EBFF29EA58C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbece0bbb6a14c173f6632f8d3e65abfb62fe6c2bc37e23eaf0a06afaeb4689d
#. default-sha256: ed15d4af486013d34843e978c58d5b83ce125839a15ccc34b6e6ecda32aa4e14
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E4DB4FB6_DCE0_4EA0_B57D_1EBFF29EA58C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every day was the same. Day in and day out, day in and day out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Todo dia era a mesma coisa. Dia após dia, dia após dia."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D05F1820_1BCD_41A9_BD3C_D2C42C2E9919
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfd4c8fe7b7b254192aebec21756f7f4d3de1f91ca85eacef09d3618ef1dea98
#. default-sha256: 27d74f450e6f066e27fb7df69631325a2c658ca1606cb15ecfa5a6a5940067b6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D05F1820_1BCD_41A9_BD3C_D2C42C2E9919"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was my mother’s handwriting on the parchment.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We lived in the same house, yet "
"she refused to show herself before me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era a letra da minha mãe no pergaminho.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nós vivíamos na mesma casa, ainda assim ela "
"se recusou a aparecer diante de mim."

#: scenario7:scenario7_70B207E1_B667_4518_A876_7A31707D2637
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df16f51e9ca4ad88fb5fcbca7b74bc64a7951a15903a7af7239d5274c7e1bba2
#. default-sha256: 3afda7a3535ffbb4a0f341fa3799fc6e6749d4841f2ea62e35cd500f22c8c447
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_70B207E1_B667_4518_A876_7A31707D2637"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no choice but to respond to her letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não tive escolha senão responder às cartas dela."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E8081A6E_6877_4A07_984A_116A51D87A8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd9eb0ccd32f47675007ca5d6a668cc1a92b63f81aaed7787b1ac8245b0353ab
#. default-sha256: 172164ebeb8271fd03a6eaa1105b7f2fa5b224b3790f2836897d5b027c2ff148
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E8081A6E_6877_4A07_984A_116A51D87A8F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a constant sense of urgency to her letters—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like she might fall apart "
"completely at any second."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Havia uma sensação constante de urgência em suas cartas —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ como se ela pudesse "
"desmoronar completamente a qualquer momento."

#: scenario7:scenario7_02554262_3CA2_40FB_B05E_478FCA02B718
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdeb686cf811bedb11c831021db0bd8d7d6dc19e1a3dc5f36a84df4823cd10f4
#. default-sha256: b5a05141e88b32bba3acc776781db74f7016d8b631e8c2eff878333d90dd1533
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_02554262_3CA2_40FB_B05E_478FCA02B718"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On paper, she expressed her concern for me, but that concern only served to cause me more "
"pain,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No papel, ela expressava sua preocupação por mim, mas essa preocupação só serviu para me "
"causar mais dor,"

